# Rust / Tauri
/src-tauri/target/
/src-tauri/gen/

# The bundled engine sidecar and its grammars (#7, docs/HANDOVER.md) --
# real binaries, platform-specific, tens of MB. release.yml builds and
# stages these fresh on each platform's own CI runner right before
# `cargo tauri build`; a local dev build wanting the sidecar path places
# them here itself, the same way `docmap-libs`/`docmap-grammars` already
# live outside any repo rather than committed into one.
/src-tauri/binaries/
/src-tauri/resources/

# Node (only used by the Tauri CLI, never at runtime)
/node_modules/

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
tags

# Generated from app-icon source by `cargo tauri icon`; regenerate rather
# than review a diff of binary pixels.
# `cargo tauri icon` also emits android/ and ios/ sets; this is a desktop
# program and they are regenerable noise in a diff.
/src-tauri/icons/android/
/src-tauri/icons/ios/
